#. Description of the plugin
#: pickup-reminder-for-packeta.php
msgid "E-mails customers before the last day their Packeta (Zásilkovna) parcel can be picked up, so fewer cash-on-delivery parcels come back. Uses the parcel status and storage date synced by the official Packeta plugin."
msgstr ""

